visit|Visiting action and countable occasion have separate ordinals. Museum vacation and one-week island visit align; verb direct object distinguished from noun visit to.
zero|Absence of messages represented by zero, with plural messages. Vietnamese natural negation preserves amount; source NUMBER supported only in continuation, and scale point is not invented as absolute no temperature.
cold|Temperature adjective and illness noun distinguished by source ordinals. Floor sensation and common cold examples translate separately; definition avoids diagnosis or treatment recommendations and source taxonomy remains unverified.
grace|Physical movement and courteous response are distinct noun meanings. Dancer and disappointing outcome preserve contrast; Vietnamese accepts điềm đạm without claiming happiness at the bad result.
inferior|Source-supported person noun interpreted as hierarchy, not a moral judgment of worth. Officer example avoids endorsing demeaning conduct; negation and subordinate relationship preserved in Vietnamese.
